OL,3,GNEWSACrews to remain at Holme Fen fire
OL,4,Auntil September
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters who have been tackling a
OL,7,Fmajor blaze at a Cambridgeshire nature
OL,8,Freserve since early August are due to
OL,9,Fremain on site until the middle of
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,12,FCrews have entered their 14th day of
OL,13,Foperations at Holme Fen, near
OL,14,FPeterborough, which has burned about
OL,15,Fhalf of the site.
OL,17,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Fsaid firefighters from all over the
OL,19,Fcountry had been working in difficult
OL,20,Fconditions to bring the blaze under
OL,21,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
