OL,3,GNEWSACrews to remain at Holme Fen fire
OL,4,Auntil September
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant chief officer Stuart Smith
OL,7,Fsaid the fire had been contained, and
OL,8,Fcrews were working with forestry
OL,9,Fspecialists to remove fallen trees so
OL,10,Ffirefighters could reach hot spots in
OL,11,Fthe peat soil below.
